# Runtime artifacts
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
# The forecast evaluation is the evidence for the Phase-2 claim, so the final
# report is versioned even though other run artifacts are not.
!results/forecast_report.md
!results/forecast_report.json
# The Phase-3 placebo ablation is historical evidence for the agents/BL claim.
!results/phase3_ablation.md
!results/phase3_ablation.json
# The Phase-4 multi-profile evaluation is the evidence for the current claim.
!results/phase4_evaluation.md
!results/phase4_evaluation.json
# The same real-data evaluation is published under its stable name for the README.
!results/evaluation.md
!results/evaluation.json
# A deterministic, reproducible worked example of the audit path.
!results/trace_example.md
!results/trace_example.json
audits/*
!audits/.gitkeep
